WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.954 --> 00:00:06.048
When its comment period ends, a breaking change goes to a vote of the working group.

2
00:00:06.848 --> 00:00:09.391
The decision panel says what the vote needs:

3
00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:13.300
half the voters taking part, and two thirds saying yes.

4
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.667
Priya votes yes.

5
00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:20.949
The other members here are simulated, and they've voted too.

6
00:00:20.949 --> 00:00:24.090
The panel shows the count, and the turnout so far.
